Lines:   7776 ("<five dice digits 1-6><TAB><word>"), dice index 11111..66666, 7776 unique words.

Cerberus uses the list to generate Diceware passphrases (crates/cerberus-crypto/src/phrase.rs).
The code checks the SHA-256 and the word count at run time and in tests.
